oon and planets computed on the\ndevice. Point at anything to see its name, magnitude and where it is.\nThe Sun, Moon, planets, stars and the International Space Station are in their real places for your location and time.\nDay and night, borders, coasts, cities and labels; looks from satellite photo to relief and night lights.\nPlaces to visit, with satellite pictures and short texts. Optional live layers: Earth events (NASA, USGS) and\nworld news (GDELT).\nMixed reality on your own floor, or a dark immersive space. Comfortable: you stand or sit, and nothing moves you.\nTouch controllers or hands, with a compact wrist menu.\n", "short_description": "The real Earth see through beneath your feet at true scale and bearings, and the real night sky above you.  Check other continents as they are in real world on other side of the world seen through the floor.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/georama/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/georama/terms", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/georama/support", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/georama/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1428732170322802"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "958811423655752"}]}, "ba